How the per-platform behaviour of fontFamily: 'Roboto' was established.
No golden was used: flutter test renders every glyph with the test font
regardless of the family, so a screenshot cannot distinguish "resolved"
from "fell back". The sources below are the installed Flutter SDK and
the host system font directories.

